WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.611
Your Mac finally

00:00:01.423 --> 00:00:02.295
gets a volume

00:00:02.107 --> 00:00:03.357
slider for every

00:00:03.168 --> 00:00:03.699
app.

00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:05.798
Smorza just launched

00:00:05.937 --> 00:00:06.679
Turn a call

00:00:06.491 --> 00:00:07.069
down

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:07.930
keep the music

00:00:07.741 --> 00:00:08.790
up and send

00:00:08.626 --> 00:00:09.262
each app to

00:00:09.074 --> 00:00:10.276
the speakers or

00:00:10.123 --> 00:00:11.373
headphones you choose

00:00:11.902 --> 00:00:12.574
It lives in

00:00:12.386 --> 00:00:13.317
your menu bar

00:00:13.199 --> 00:00:14.142
and it installs

00:00:13.954 --> 00:00:15.239
no audio driver

00:00:15.378 --> 00:00:16.156
It uses the

00:00:15.968 --> 00:00:17.123
audio taps Apple

00:00:16.935 --> 00:00:18.219
added in macOS

00:00:18.031 --> 00:00:19.245
14.4

00:00:19.766 --> 00:00:20.768
It's free and

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:21.758
open source for

00:00:21.570 --> 00:00:22.855
Apple silicon and

00:00:22.679 --> 00:00:23.775
Intel Macs

00:00:24.294 --> 00:00:25.308
Full story on

00:00:25.119 --> 00:00:26.015
the dashboard
